{"id":"18136c497ae27b10","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Level Projection Map","display":"df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map — ZFC Tree11 Level Projection Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map — ZFC Tree11 Level Projection Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map — ZFC Tree11 Level Projection Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (tree of finite sequences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (finite level)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> (projection to level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span> (node bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,L,H\\in V\">\\(D,L,H\\in V\\)</span> (projection domain, level, and finite-sequence carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProjectionMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProjectionMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}level\\text{-}projection\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProjectionMap}_S(\\pi,T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists D,L,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\subseteq H\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in H\\;(v\\subseteq u\\to v\\in T))\\land D=\\{t\\in T:n\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\land L=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{dom}(t)=n\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,D,L)\\land\\forall t\\in D\\;(\\pi(t)=t\\upharpoonright n)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}level\\text{-}projection\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProjectionMap}_S(\\pi,T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists D,L,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\subseteq H\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in H\\;(v\\subseteq u\\to v\\in T))\\land D=\\{t\\in T:n\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\land L=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{dom}(t)=n\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,D,L)\\land\\forall t\\in D\\;(\\pi(t)=t\\upharpoonright n)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The prefix-closure clause makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> an actual tree, so every restriction <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\upharpoonright n\">\\(t\\upharpoonright n\\)</span> in the stated domain belongs to the level-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"D,L,H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProjectionMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}level\\text{-}projection\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProjectionMap}_S(\\pi,T,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists D,L,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\subseteq H\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in H\\;(v\\subseteq u\\to v\\in T))\\land D=\\{t\\in T:n\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\land L=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{dom}(t)=n\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,D,L)\\land\\forall t\\in D\\;(\\pi(t)=t\\upharpoonright n)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"t\\upharpoonright n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1480,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3793","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-level-projection-map]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","f4bf86f66c1444da"]}